{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1059580-guardian-angel-stats","id":1059580,"title":"Guardian Angel Stats","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-07T09:54:30-08:00","id":1059580,"title":"Guardian Angel Stats","content":"I was wondering if anyone knows where I can find the stats of a Guardian Angel or at least the closest equivalent in the Classic World of Darkness for use in Mage. If there's no close equivalent, any suggestions would be appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T09:56:59-08:00","id":1059582,"title":"","content":"Spirit wise: There are a few Angel stats in Book of Worlds, and all the Patronage stuff with the muses in Infinite Tapestry can really easily be converted over to whatever mythology and lore you prefer.<br /> Forged By Dragon's Fire has a few Angel bound Fetishes which give you some Angel stats.<br /> Other than that, there's probably something in the old Book of Madness, though I can't confirm.<br /> <br /> However, I think guardian angels would fit better as someone's interpretation of their Avatar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T13:16:35-08:00","id":1059707,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacecat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1059580-guardian-angel-stats#post1059580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was wondering if anyone knows where I can find the stats of a Guardian Angel or at least the closest equivalent in the Classic World of Darkness for use in Mage. If there's no close equivalent, any suggestions would be appreciated.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you talking about the Merit?<br /> <br /> Because that &quot;Guardian&quot; could be anything you wanna - Vampire, Fera, mummy, an actual &quot;angel&quot; (whatever that may be for you - umbrood from high umbra or whatever)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13085-agentsmith","name":"AgentSmith","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T13:24:55-08:00","id":1059714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AgentSmith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1059580-guardian-angel-stats?p=1059707#post1059707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are you talking about the Merit?<br /> <br /> Because that &quot;Guardian&quot; could be anything you wanna - Vampire, Fera, mummy, an actual &quot;angel&quot; (whatever that may be for you - umbrood from high umbra or whatever)</div> </div> </div> </div>No, not the merit. The creature or spirit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T14:00:54-08:00","id":1059730,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacecat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1059580-guardian-angel-stats?p=1059714#post1059714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, not the merit. The creature or spirit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, ok. Well, like Saikou said. Those are, however, only Umbrood from the High Umbra.<br /> <br /> There is no equivalent of &quot;True Angels&quot;, which would be the counter part of the &quot;demons&quot; trapped in the Abyss in Demon the Fallen.<br /> <br /> But Umbroods are just fine for that role","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13085-agentsmith","name":"AgentSmith","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T14:24:21-08:00","id":1059751,"title":"","content":"Yup. I just need a gauge of what they are like. Thanks.<br /> I don't have access to those but maybe one of my friends bought them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T15:40:57-08:00","id":1059793,"title":"","content":"Check out page 90 of Time of Judgment - there are notes and stats there for true angels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2543-thebian","name":"Thebian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2543_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T16:23:19-08:00","id":1059813,"title":"","content":"Also there is some cool angel stuff in the back of Blood treachery","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T18:04:17-08:00","id":1059852,"title":"","content":"Great. Now I'm wondering if I want to use a spirit or a true angel.<br /> <br /> It's for that crazy rote list project of mine that I'll use in my games.<br /> <br /> I'm currently on Celestial Chorus rotes making a rote that asks for the intercession of your guardian angel. Any suggestions?<br /> <br /> (So far the Akashic Brotherhood has around 120 rotes and the Chorus has 54)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","user":"Spacecat","date":". 03-07-2017, 09:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T18:15:31-08:00","id":1059858,"title":"","content":"Mind you there is a bit of a break between the Gnostic angels the order of Hermes talks to and the angels the choir sings to. It doesn't have to be a true angel per say, a spirit of protection might appear to a choir member in the guise of an angle as much as it might appear to a dream speaker as an ancestor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T22:32:24-08:00","id":1059947,"title":"","content":"It's worth remembering that, as much as we might bandy about terms like &quot;True Demon&quot; or &quot;True Angel&quot; up here in Player &amp; Storyteller Land, in-universe the distinction isn't obvious. If a person in the World of Darkness met a shining being with white wings, that said &quot;Be Not Afraid&quot;, and claimed to speak on behalf of the Almighty, how could that person possibly begin to determine if that being was a &quot;True&quot; Angel, or an angelic spirit created from human thoughts and beliefs? Why would that person even assume there were more than just the one kind of angel?<br /> <br /> All I'm saying is, if it looks like a duck, walks like a duck, and quacks like a duck...for all intents and purposes, it might as well be a duck.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T23:50:17-08:00","id":1059967,"title":"","content":"Good points. Thus a bit of my problem. I, being in control of writing of this rote for my games, know that the players that will use this will not actually care (and possibly not know) which one of the two they get aid from so long as they get meaningful aid. I'm thinking it would be more thematic to write in a real guardian angel but am wondering if there is anything I should consider before writing this in, mainly so I won't feel like rewriting the rote in the future.<br /> <br /> So, assuming I want to write a rote as being able to pester a least angel, as per the Time of Judgement rules, assigned to your spiritual welfare, is there anything I should be thinking about?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","user":"Spacecat","date":". 03-08-2017, 02:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T00:02:43-08:00","id":1059971,"title":"","content":"Shouldn't Guardian angels be assigned to a person rather then just a generic angle who protects? It's like the difference between a bodyguard and a police officer.<br /> <br /> If it's an actual bona-fided Clarence wouldn't it be better taken as an ally?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T00:19:53-08:00","id":1059973,"title":"","content":"Indeed, the entire point behind a guardian angel is that it's a distinct angelic being that gets assigned to a human at birth, and remains with them until they die. Any Rote created to summon a &quot;Guardian Angel&quot; would be designed around summoning the summoner's specific angel.<br /> <br /> (Funnily enough, there is precedence for this in Western Esoterism. It comes from <a href=\"http://ultraculture.org/blog/2016/01/31/holy-guardian-angel-abramelin/\" target=\"_blank\">The Book of the Sacred Magic of Abramelin the Mage</a>, a Kabbalistic text which details a ritual for communing with one's Holy Guardian Angel. Through this communion, further ritual work can be done to channel the angel's power in a conscious fashion, towards a variety of purposes. It was studied by the founders of the Golden Dawn, and was further adopted and adapted by Crowley and other occult thinkers.)<br /> <br /> If you want a Rote designed to summon a generic angel, treat it as any other spirit and see where it goes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T00:33:57-08:00","id":1059977,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the confusion, I meant Least Angel in terms of Low Ranking Angel with a faith of 25, which I had assumed would be about right for your personal assigned guardian angel. And the rote is meant to contact your particular guardian angel. As for getting it as an ally, I consider that as a possible outcome of calling for its aid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T00:44:57-08:00","id":1059981,"title":"","content":"It depends how you handle guardian angels.<br /> If you can summon one that means either that every human has one (parallel to an Avatar or as Avatar) or that your thoughts are enough to summon \u201cyour\u201c guardian angel from the High Umbra.<br /> <br /> If not every human has one and it doesn't come from the High Umbra, then the rote can summon nothing. Then you have to take an ally first, which in turn makes the rote rather pointless.<br /> <br /> I would use the High Umbran option.<br /> So without the rote the guardian angel can not influence the world in a direct way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T01:33:57-08:00","id":1059989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacecat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1059580-guardian-angel-stats?p=1059977#post1059977\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And the rote is meant to contact your particular guardian angel.</div> </div> </div> </div>So what's to keep the party from adapting the rote to their personal paradigm and suddenly everyone has their own personal Clarence?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13009,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","user":"BurritoMage","date":". 03-08-2017, 04:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T03:46:18-08:00","id":1060016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BurritoMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1059580-guardian-angel-stats?p=1059989#post1059989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So what's to keep the party from adapting the rote to their personal paradigm and suddenly everyone has their own personal Clarence?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not much apart from personal beliefs, the fact that not everyone will have the right spheres, and the fact that I'll ensure that the guardian angels meddle in their personal lives to try to make them &quot;better people&quot;. But I've seen weirder stunts so I'm not worried about that. One guy I knew made a site that became the base of his army of quintessence collecting &quot;Porn Spirits&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T05:57:27-08:00","id":1060040,"title":"","content":"So far my assumptions here are, (almost) every human has a guardian angel that watches over him/her but is generally stuck in that place angels stay and do their work outside of material reality. The angel will be built as a 25 faith angel as per the Time of Judgement book, but really can't manifest in the material world. I'd like to give it some minor powers that could be mistaken for coincidence that it could use to try to steer you towards the path of &quot;goodness&quot;. Maybe the ability to make coincidental omens or something. The rote basically allows it to manifest in the material world (without requiring authorization from the higher powers, like a sort of heavenly bureaucratic loophole). This manifested being will have your best interests at heart from the perspective of you becoming more saintly, and fighting the forces of hatred, sin, and cruelty as good. It will have little care for much else other than other people's spiritual well-being and the greater good. It will generally respect free will but nonetheless pester the mage over what it thinks are bad choices. It will act like a parent or guardian. That's what i'm thinking of for now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T06:25:50-08:00","id":1060050,"title":"","content":"What's the duration on this rote because that reads like its just a summon a super best friend ally that is immune to paradox bleed and judges you on life choices. Also why does it give a toss about other people when it's the summoners Guardian angle?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T07:58:24-08:00","id":1060085,"title":"","content":"You got me thinking there. After some thought...<br /> <br /> So far, I have it as a Spirit 2 Prime 2 spell which uses a heavenly bureaucracy loophole to grant your Guardian Angel the proper permissions to appear in the material world (but does not force it to do so), to let it take a direct hand in aiding the mage in becoming a &quot;good person&quot; and in removing the influence of evil from the mage. It is meant to act like a spiritual parent or guardian. (So getting it to do stuff other than saving you from your own evil and from actual evil will require some negotiation). The rote essentially has the same duration as any spell can have but does not prevent the angel from leaving when it wants to.<br /> <br /> As for why it cares about other people, only because it doesn't want to give other guardian angels a hard time. In other words it tries not to lead to the corruption and loss of faith of others and might actually feel like trying to discipline them too if they are a bad influence on the mage.<br /> <br /> Depending on the mage, it can be an awesome ally or a total disaster. The mage has no real say over it and it is immune to mind control.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-23T16:14:33-08:00","id":1425805,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacecat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1059580-guardian-angel-stats?p=1060085#post1060085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You got me thinking there. After some thought...<br /> <br /> So far, I have it as a Spirit 2 Prime 2 spell which uses a heavenly bureaucracy loophole to grant your Guardian Angel the proper permissions to appear in the material world (but does not force it to do so), to let it take a direct hand in aiding the mage in becoming a &quot;good person&quot; and in removing the influence of evil from the mage. It is meant to act like a spiritual parent or guardian. (So getting it to do stuff other than saving you from your own evil and from actual evil will require some negotiation). The rote essentially has the same duration as any spell can have but does not prevent the angel from leaving when it wants to.<br /> <br /> As for why it cares about other people, only because it doesn't want to give other guardian angels a hard time. In other words it tries not to lead to the corruption and loss of faith of others and might actually feel like trying to discipline them too if they are a bad influence on the mage.<br /> <br /> Depending on the mage, it can be an awesome ally or a total disaster. The mage has no real say over it and it is immune to mind control.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think you need Spirit 3 to summon a Spirit and Spirit 4 to summon an angel or demon because they're so powerful. And I think it's Spirit 4/Prime 4 to make a body for a spirit (&quot;How do you DO That?&quot; Page 45).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26432-jagnestormskull","name":"JagneStormskull","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26432_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-23T20:57:36-08:00","id":1425849,"title":"","content":"I <i>really</i> wish they'd put Feats more front and center in Mage. \u201cThey're more powerful\u201d shouldn't generally be a justification for requiring more dots; it should, rather, require more successes. <br /> <br /> Rather than talking about \u201ca Spirit 3 Effect to summon spirits, and a Spirit 4 Effect to summon angels and demons\u201d, we should be talking about \u201ca Standard Spirit 3 Effect to summon spirits, and a Difficult Spirit 3 Effect to summon angels and demons\u201d, or something to that effect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-23T22:13:19-08:00","id":1425859,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nonsense</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">So without the rote the guardian angel can not influence the world in a direct way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, what? All you have to do is lower the Gauntlet level via a simple Arete roll if you have the Spirit Sphere up to at least 2 (which is very basic) and the Spirit that you have follows you on the other side to have the Materialize charm/power. All it takes is for the Gauntlet level to be lowed to even or lower than the permanent Gnosis rating that Umbrood has. After that it can practically do anything it wants for at least a scene or longer if the ST has it where a certain area has a constant low Gauntlet level.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BurritoMage</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">immune to paradox bleed</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought only Constructs and Familiars were subject to Paradox? I'm pretty sure Spirits from the Middle &amp; High Umbra are immune to paradox. Embodied (aka materialized past the Shroud) Wraiths also don't suffer Paradox either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-24T08:10:49-08:00","id":1425958,"title":"","content":"Arise, Necro Thread, Arise!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-24T10:36:49-08:00","id":1426000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1059580-guardian-angel-stats?p=1425849#post1425849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I <i>really</i> wish they'd put Feats more front and center in Mage. \u201cThey're more powerful\u201d shouldn't generally be a justification for requiring more dots; it should, rather, require more successes.<br /> <br /> Rather than talking about \u201ca Spirit 3 Effect to summon spirits, and a Spirit 4 Effect to summon angels and demons\u201d, we should be talking about \u201ca Standard Spirit 3 Effect to summon spirits, and a Difficult Spirit 3 Effect to summon angels and demons\u201d, or something to that effect.</div> </div> </div> </div>That makes sense. Keep Spirit 4 for advanced Gauntlet manipulation and Fetish creation.<br /> <br /> In fact, it makes too much sense for White Wolf authors /s.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26432-jagnestormskull","name":"JagneStormskull","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26432_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-26T06:40:34-08:00","id":1429941,"title":"","content":"In my current game with my sorcerer, he is a celestial/angel summoner with S/B/W and he has the summon guardian angel ritual. The ST and I agreed that his guardian angel was simply assigned to him after he summoned it forth and bargained with it successfully. The stats for it however are vague. The ST simply has it hang in the background and help me and my mage allies when I cast a blessing on others or myself, throw curses, or need story based guidance.<br /> <br /> My sorcerer is strong enough to easily compel it to do what he wants, but that does not fit his paradigm. And as to whether these are True Angels or generic Spirit Angels, I can definitely say that his guardian angel is just a generic celestial spirit that works for heaven/the high umbra, but is not a true angel since it is a gaffling level entity. It is the Jaggling and Incarna level beings that are True Angels. My sorcerer plans to summon a Serpahim of battle next session hopefully.<br /> <br /> Note: If we are to use Demon: The Fallen cosmology, it would be really hard to summon forth True Angels. Time of Judgement states that all angels are bound to heaven and by divine decree cannot leave heaven until the end times. So that means summoning one forth would make it break this divine law and thus they would instantly become a fallen/demon. But this is just one optional rule and STs of course can ignore it. The other thing about True Angels is that they are VERY powerful beings. Even the weakest of angels has like 15 or 25 True Faith and a bunch of abilities and immunities. A mage or sorcerer being able to summon such an entity should be very hard to do and used with caution.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24121,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24121-starcomet","user":"Starcomet","date":".  Adding a bit more info. 12-26-2020, 10:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24121-starcomet","name":"Starcomet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24121_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}